# Generated anchor plans. `crowdflow anchors plan <id> --write` produces these,
# and a plan is not data: every anchor in it is provenance=assumed, and a 1.8 MB
# file of guessed hardware positions committed beside a surveyed circuit pack
# reads as a survey to anybody who does not open it. Regenerate on demand; commit
# only a real, walked survey.
circuits/*/pack/anchors.json